 942:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * Function reads the value of TRBSR register. It masks the standard transmit buffer interrupt flag
 943:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * buffer error flag before providing the value.
